        <p class="text-muted text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-8">
          A successful defense against GST demand and scrutiny notices requires structured legal argumentation, factual substantiation with primary evidence, and adherence to strict statutory timelines. Follow this standard 4-step litigation procedure:
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
