            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-base bg-surface p-6 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent/10 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent">04</span>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-base">File Electronically within 30 Days</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed">
